{"seq":3,"slug":"data-converters-adc-dac","title":"数据转换器 ADC 与 DAC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/opamps-and-building-blocks/data-converters-adc-dac","wordCount":2469,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据转换器-adc-与-dac\">数据转换器 ADC 与 DAC</h1><p>模拟世界连续、无限精细，数字世界离散、有限位宽——ADC 与 DAC 就是这两个世界之间唯一的边境口岸。一颗麦克风采到的声波、一段射频天线收到的电磁信号，最终要进 CPU 或 DSP 计算，必须先被 ADC 切成一串整数；反过来，扬声器要发声、相控阵要发射,DSP 算出的整数又得经 DAC 还原成电压或电流。运放在这条链路里不是配角:采样保持的缓冲、参考电压的基准、流水线级间的余量放大,几乎每一步都靠运放和比较器撑着。理解转换器,本质上是理解&quot;如何在噪声、速度、功耗三者之间做有原则的取舍&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-采样-量化与四类架构\">核心概念:采样、量化与四类架构</h2><p>任何 ADC 都做两件事:在时间上采样(把连续时间变成离散时刻),在幅度上量化(把连续电压映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个码字)。两步分别引入两类不可逆的误差——孔径抖动让&quot;该在何时采&quot;变得模糊,量化误差让&quot;采到多少&quot;只能取整。DAC 是逆过程,但同样受限于元件失配与切换瞬态。</p>\n<p>主流架构按&quot;用什么策略逼近真值&quot;分为四类,它们在速度-分辨率平面上各占一块,几乎不重叠:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  IN[模拟输入] --&gt; SH[采样保持]&#10;  SH --&gt; FLASH[Flash&lt;br/&gt;2^N-1 个比较器并行&lt;br/&gt;极快/低位宽/高功耗]&#10;  SH --&gt; SAR[SAR&lt;br/&gt;内部 DAC 二分搜索&lt;br/&gt;中速/中高位宽/低功耗]&#10;  SH --&gt; PIPE[Pipeline&lt;br/&gt;多级级联流水&lt;br/&gt;高速/中位宽/有延迟]&#10;  SH --&gt; SD[Delta-Sigma&lt;br/&gt;过采样+噪声整形&lt;br/&gt;低带宽/超高位宽]&#10;  FLASH --&gt; OUT[数字码]&#10;  SAR --&gt; OUT&#10;  PIPE --&gt; OUT&#10;  SD --&gt; OUT\">flowchart TD\n  IN[模拟输入] --&gt; SH[采样保持]\n  SH --&gt; FLASH[Flash&lt;br/&gt;2^N-1 个比较器并行&lt;br/&gt;极快/低位宽/高功耗]\n  SH --&gt; SAR[SAR&lt;br/&gt;内部 DAC 二分搜索&lt;br/&gt;中速/中高位宽/低功耗]\n  SH --&gt; PIPE[Pipeline&lt;br/&gt;多级级联流水&lt;br/&gt;高速/中位宽/有延迟]\n  SH --&gt; SD[Delta-Sigma&lt;br/&gt;过采样+噪声整形&lt;br/&gt;低带宽/超高位宽]\n  FLASH --&gt; OUT[数字码]\n  SAR --&gt; OUT\n  PIPE --&gt; OUT\n  SD --&gt; OUT</pre><p>四类架构的定位差异极大,选型从来不是&quot;挑位数最高的&quot;,而是先看带宽和延迟需求(<a href=\"https://www.ersaelectronics.com/blog/adc-types-sar-delta-sigma-pipeline-flash\">ADC Types: SAR, Delta-Sigma, Pipeline, Flash, ersaelectronics.com</a>):</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>典型分辨率</th>\n<th>典型采样率</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Flash</td>\n<td>4–8 bit</td>\n<td>GSPS 级</td>\n<td>极低(1 周期)</td>\n<td>示波器前端、超宽带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SAR</td>\n<td>8–18 bit</td>\n<td>kSPS–MSPS</td>\n<td>低(N 周期)</td>\n<td>工业采集、电池供电传感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pipeline</td>\n<td>12–16 bit</td>\n<td>数十–数百 MSPS</td>\n<td>高(级数个周期)</td>\n<td>通信、视频、雷达中频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Delta-Sigma</td>\n<td>16–24 bit</td>\n<td>100 kHz–10 MHz 带宽</td>\n<td>高(数字滤波器)</td>\n<td>音频、精密测量、电表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"量化噪声与那条著名公式\">量化噪声与那条著名公式</h2><p>把连续电压塞进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个台阶,最大量化误差是半个最低有效位(LSB)。假设误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>LSB</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>LSB</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-\\frac{1}{2}\\text{LSB}, +\\frac{1}{2}\\text{LSB}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LSB</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LSB</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 内均匀分布,其均方根值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>q</mi><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{q}{\\sqrt{12}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2855em;vertical-align:-0.538em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7475em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.551em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9128em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8728em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1272em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.538em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 为一个 LSB 对应的电压)。把满幅正弦的有效值除以这个噪声,得到理想 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 位 ADC 的信噪比:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SNR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>6.02</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.76</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SNR} = 6.02N + 1.76\\ \\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式是数据转换器领域的&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E=mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&quot;。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6.02</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6.02 \\approx 20\\log_{10}2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>,意味着每多一位,量化噪声减半、SNR 抬高约 6 dB;那个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.76</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.76</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span></span></span></span></span> dB 则来自正弦满幅有效值与量化噪声分布的几何关系(<a href=\"https://www.analog.com/media/en/training-seminars/tutorials/mt-001.pdf\">Analog Devices MT-001 Tutorial</a>)。</p>\n<p>过采样能&quot;借&quot;出额外位数。以过采样率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OSR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OSR} = M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OSR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>(实际采样率相对奈奎斯特率的倍数)采样,把同样的量化噪声功率摊到更宽的频带,再用数字滤波器只保留信号带宽,信噪比变为:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SQNR</mtext><mtext>OS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.76</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6.02</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SQNR}_{\\text{OS}} = 1.76 + \\left(N + \\frac{M}{4}\\right)\\cdot 6.02\\ \\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SQNR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">OS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>OSR 每翻 4 倍,等效多 1 位。Delta-Sigma 正是把这招用到极致:不仅过采样,还用反馈环把量化噪声&quot;整形&quot;到高频去,再滤掉,从而以 1 位的粗量化器换来 20 位以上的有效精度(<a href=\"https://testbook.com/electronics-engineering/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-sqnr-in-pcm\">Testbook: SQNR formula</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sar-与-delta-sigma-两种主流哲学\">SAR 与 Delta-Sigma:两种主流哲学</h2><p>SAR(逐次逼近)是工业界用量最大的架构。它内部藏着一颗 DAC 和一个比较器,每个采样周期做一次二分搜索:先猜最高位是 0 还是 1,让内部 DAC 输出对应电压与采样值比较,逐位敲定,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 位就用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个时钟周期。它没有流水线延迟、关机即省电、单次转换即出结果,因此特别适合多路复用的传感器采集和电池供电场景。</p>\n<p>Delta-Sigma 走的是相反路线——用&quot;快而粗&quot;换&quot;慢而精&quot;。它以远高于奈奎斯特率的频率,用 1 位或几位量化器粗采,靠反馈环路把量化噪声往高频推(噪声整形),再用 decimation 数字滤波器把高频噪声连同带外信号一起滤掉,降回奈奎斯特率输出。高 OSR(典型 10–128)还让模拟抗混叠滤波器可以做得极简单。代价是带宽受限、延迟大。近年连续时间 Delta-Sigma 在通信带宽上不断突破,有实现做到 40 MHz 信号带宽内 11-bit ENOB、76.5 dBc THD,功耗仅 82.3 mW(<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/1424-8220/23/1/36\">MDPI Sensors, 40 MHz 11-bit ENOB Delta-Sigma ADC</a>)。</p>\n<p>二者的取舍可以这样对照:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>SAR</th>\n<th>Delta-Sigma</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心机制</td>\n<td>二分搜索(内部 DAC)</td>\n<td>过采样 + 噪声整形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>低(无 pipeline)</td>\n<td>高(数字滤波器群延迟)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗混叠滤波</td>\n<td>需较陡的模拟滤波</td>\n<td>可极简(高 OSR)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关机省电</td>\n<td>容易(逐次转换)</td>\n<td>较难(连续运行)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>甜区</td>\n<td>中速、低功耗、多路</td>\n<td>高精度、低带宽、音频/电表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"enob-从理论-snr-到真实可用位数\">ENOB:从理论 SNR 到真实可用位数</h2><p>数据手册标的位数(分辨率)和实际能用的精度往往差好几位。把所有噪声与失真——量化噪声、热噪声、谐波失真、时钟抖动——一锅算进信纳比(SINAD),再反代回那条公式,得到有效位数:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ENOB</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>SINAD</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>1.76</mn></mrow><mn>6.02</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ENOB} = \\frac{\\text{SINAD} - 1.76}{6.02}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ENOB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SINAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一颗标称 16 位的高速 ADC,实测 ENOB 可能只有 12–13 位。差距主要来自采样保持的孔径抖动和参考电压噪声。孔径抖动尤其致命:输入信号频率越高,采样时刻的微小不确定带来的电压误差越大,抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 造成的 SNR 上限为:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SNR</mtext><mtext>jitter</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SNR}_{\\text{jitter}} = -20\\log_{10}(2\\pi f_{\\text{in}} t_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">jitter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在真实设计里,采样保持的孔径与抖动、驱动运放的建立时间、参考源的噪声,这三者共同决定了可用的 ENOB 和带宽,而不是手册首页那个位数(<a href=\"https://www.analog.com/mt-001\">Analog Devices MT-001</a>)。这也解释了为什么高速 ADC 的时钟源(低抖动)和前端驱动运放的选择,常常比 ADC 芯片本身更难。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dac-架构-r-2r-电流舵与分段编码\">DAC 架构:R-2R、电流舵与分段编码</h2><p>DAC 把数字码还原成模拟量,主流有三类结构。电阻串(string)DAC 用一长串等值电阻分压,单调性天然保证,适合低速高精度。R-2R 阶梯网络只用两种阻值的电阻,把输入电流分成二进制加权的支路,按数字位导向不同节点,面积小、易集成。电流舵(current-steering)DAC 用一组电流源,按码字把电流舵向输出,是高速 DAC 的主力。</p>\n<p>高速 DAC 的头号敌人是毛刺(glitch):码字切换瞬间,各支路开关时序不齐,输出电流产生尖峰。由于毛刺幅度随码字非线性变化,会在输出频谱里冒出杂散音,直接拉低无杂散动态范围(SFDR)。两种关键对策:一是温度计编码(thermometer/unary),用单调递增的开关替代二进制权重,牺牲面积换取匹配度和低毛刺;二是动态元件匹配(DEM),利用单元冗余把失配带来的失真&quot;打散&quot;成白噪声,显著抬高 SFDR(<a href=\"https://wiki.analog.com/university/courses/tutorials/cmos-dac-chapter\">Analog Devices Wiki: Current Steering DACs</a>)。</p>\n<p>实践中几乎不会纯用某一种。主流是分段(segmented)架构:高位用温度计编码保证低毛刺与单调性,低位用二进制(或 R-2R)节省面积。例如有 20 nm CMOS 工艺的 14-bit 750 MS/s DAC,采用低毛刺混合 R-2R 架构,在超过奈奎斯特频率处仍达到 −168 dBm/Hz 噪声底和 79 dBc SFDR(<a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/308815436_A_14b_750MSs_DAC_in_20nm_CMOS_with_-168dBmHz_noise_floor_beyond_Nyquist_and_79dBc_SFDR_utilizing_a_low_glitch-noise_hybrid_R-2R_architecture\">14b 750MS/s DAC, hybrid R-2R, ResearchGate</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-前沿-rf-直采与-gsps-转换器\">2026 前沿:RF 直采与 GSPS 转换器</h2><p>过去二十年,ADC 采样率从 2000 年顶尖水平不到 100 MSPS,跃升到如今动辄超过 10 GSPS,催生了&quot;RF 直采&quot;这一范式转变——把天线信号不经下变频直接数字化,省掉混频器和本振链路(<a href=\"https://www.analog.com/en/resources/technical-articles/considering-gsps-adcs-in-rf-systems.html\">Analog Devices: Considering GSPS ADCs in RF Systems</a>)。这对相控阵雷达、软件定义无线电、电子战接收机意义重大:射频链路从&quot;模拟为主&quot;变成&quot;采样越往天线推越好&quot;。</p>\n<p>当前商用顶端的代表:TI 的 ADC12DJ5200RF 号称业界带宽最宽、采样率最快、功耗最低的 ADC,单通道 10.4 GSPS、8 GHz 带宽,可瞬时捕获最高 5.2 GHz 带宽;其 ADC12DJ4000RF 提供单通道 8 GSPS / 双通道 4 GSPS 的 12 位直采能力(<a href=\"https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/adc12dj4000rf.pdf\">TI ADC12DJ4000RF Datasheet</a>)。Analog Devices 一侧,AD9625 是 12 位单片 ADC,转换率达 2.6 GSPS(<a href=\"https://www.analog.com/en/products/ad9625.html\">Analog Devices AD9625</a>)。这一代器件普遍走 JESD204 高速串行接口把海量数据吐给 FPGA。</p>\n<p>GSPS 器件也带来新的模拟设计难题:其电源方案(开关电源 vs LDO)直接影响杂散和噪声底,前端驱动运放要在 GHz 带宽下保持线性,时钟分配网络对抖动的要求逼近飞秒量级——又回到了那条孔径抖动公式(<a href=\"https://www.analog.com/en/resources/technical-articles/powering-gsps-or-rf-sampling-adc-switcher-vs-ldo.html\">Analog Devices: Powering GSPS / RF Sampling ADCs</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ADC/DAC 是模拟与数字之间唯一的转换边界,任何采集与还原系统都绕不开它;运放与比较器是其内部的基础模块。</li>\n<li>理想 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 位 ADC 的信噪比由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SNR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>6.02</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.76</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SNR} = 6.02N + 1.76</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span></span></span></span></span> dB 决定,每多一位约 +6 dB;过采样 OSR 每翻 4 倍等效多 1 位。</li>\n<li>四类架构(Flash / SAR / Pipeline / Delta-Sigma)在速度-分辨率平面上各占一隅,选型先看带宽与延迟而非位数。</li>\n<li>真实可用精度看 ENOB,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ENOB</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>SINAD</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>1.76</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ENOB} = (\\text{SINAD} - 1.76)/6.02</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ENOB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SINAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/6.02</span></span></span></span></span>;孔径抖动、参考噪声、驱动建立时间常是瓶颈,高频下抖动尤其致命。</li>\n<li>DAC 的核心矛盾是高速下的毛刺与 SFDR,主流用分段架构(温度计高位 + 二进制/R-2R 低位)配合 DEM 求解。</li>\n<li>2026 的前沿是 RF 直采与 GSPS 转换器(TI ADC12DJ5200RF 达 10.4 GSPS),把数字化往天线方向推,代价是对电源、时钟抖动、前端线性度的极致要求。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据转换器 ADC 与 DAC","id":"数据转换器-adc-与-dac"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念:采样、量化与四类架构","id":"核心概念-采样-量化与四类架构"},{"level":2,"text":"量化噪声与那条著名公式","id":"量化噪声与那条著名公式"},{"level":2,"text":"SAR 与 Delta-Sigma:两种主流哲学","id":"sar-与-delta-sigma-两种主流哲学"},{"level":2,"text":"ENOB:从理论 SNR 到真实可用位数","id":"enob-从理论-snr-到真实可用位数"},{"level":2,"text":"DAC 架构:R-2R、电流舵与分段编码","id":"dac-架构-r-2r-电流舵与分段编码"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 前沿:RF 直采与 GSPS 转换器","id":"2026-前沿-rf-直采与-gsps-转换器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"滤波器与振荡器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/opamps-and-building-blocks/filters-and-oscillators"},"next":{"title":"噪声与失真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/practice-and-reliability/noise-and-distortion"}}